
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Website Pribadi Saya</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #101827;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header {
      padding: 65px 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #111827);
    }
    h1 { font-size: 34px; }
    section { padding: 25px 20px; }
    .card {
      background: #1f2937;
      padding: 22px;
      margin: 15px auto;
      border-radius: 15px;
      max-width: 420px;
    }
    a {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #22c55e;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    footer {
      padding: 20px;
      color: #9ca3af;
    }
  </style>
<style>
/* Efek neon */
h1, h2, h3 {
  text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00eaff,
               0 0 18px #008cff;
}

/* Latar bintang bergerak */
#star-background {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: -1;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
}

#star-background::before,
#star-background::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: -100%;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 40px 60px, #fff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 120px 180px, #00eaff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 220px 90px, #fff, transparent),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 300px 240px, #8c7bff, transparent);
  background-size: 350px 300px;
  animation: starMove 35s linear infinite;
}

#star-background::after {
  opacity: 0.5;
  animation-duration: 55s;
  animation-direction: reverse;
}

@keyframes starMove {
  from { transform: translateY(0); }
  to { transform: translateY(300px); }
}

/* Efek neon pada foto */
img {
  transition: filter 0.3s ease;
}

img:hover {
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px #00eaff);
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  #star-background::before,
  #star-background::after {
    animation: none;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="star-background" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header>
    <h1>Halo, Saya Irfan!</h1>
    <p>Selamat datang di website pribadi saya.</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Tentang Saya</h2>
      <p>Ini adalah website pribadi saya.
      Saya suka belajar hal baru dan bermain game.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Hobi Saya</h2>
      <p>Bermain game, mendengarkan musik,
      dan menjelajahi teknologi.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Hubungi Saya</h2>
      <p>Silakan hubungi saya melalui WhatsApp.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/62XXXXXXXXXX">
        WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Website Pribadi Saya
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
